postgresql-pg-vault-tde (1.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * v1.6: Local PKCS#12 wallet KMS provider (offline/air-gapped support).
  * Flexible passphrase sources: env var, file, command, dev_mode.
  * wallet_unlock/lock/rotate_kek/export_bundle/import_bundle SQL functions.
  * Online Vault-to-wallet migration (pg_vault_tde_migrate_vault_to_wallet).
  * Support for PostgreSQL 17 and 18 from a single source package.
  * 72 regression tests passing.

 -- Miriade Srl <info@miriade.it>  Tue, 04 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0100

postgresql-pg-vault-tde (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * AES-256-GCM transparent encryption via Table Access Method API.
  * Support for PostgreSQL 18.
  * All 24 regression tests pass, including page-checksum compatibility.

